Z||000000||Mattsfiero||10-01-2000||02:06 PM||||well in less then three miles My car chance will reach 150k miles. She is still running simply awsome and to top it off getting her preped for a complete and total rebuild. The body will leave for the shop and engine remain with me while it is being rebuilt as if there where no miles left on her. <P>Just felt like sharing the news.<P>Matt  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000001||mrfiero||10-01-2000||08:41 PM||||Congratulations!  If you care for your cars they will last.  My '88 GT has 134K miles on it and at my current pace I should top 150K by Christmas (I've logged 22K miles in 4 months of driving!).  It smokes a little, but still runs and drives great......in fact, I just finished a 7700 mile trip in it (half of that towing another car).<P><BR>Keep taking good care of your Fiero and let us know when you hit 200K!! <BR>||||reg||10
